00:44:13,740 --> 00:44:24,060
And what I hope you saw was a lot of innovation happening at all layers of the stack, from the hardware to the data centers to the serverless offerings, to GPUs, prompt prefetching,

479
00:44:24,060 --> 00:44:31,590
inference, and then a look at the future and where we might be going with networking inside the data center.

